yty|n|The commodities sold by grocers, as tea, coffee, spices, etc.; -- in the United States almost always in the plural form, in this sense. ; A retail grocer's shop or store.	a:1afy,72,9~1afy,72,9	N:24q6,96,54;20me,88,4;24qc,85,2;gnm,46,1;1a7d,40,3~24q6,96,54;20me,88,4;1a7d,40,3;24qc,85,2;gnm,46,1
