yuo|n|A furrow, channel, or long hollow, such as may be formed by cutting, molding, grinding, the wearing force of flowing water, or constant travel; a depressed way; a worn path; a rut. ; Hence: The habitual course of life, work, or affairs; fixed routine. ; A shaft or excavation.	N:16jz,76,4;1ff1,70,3~16jz,76,4;1ff1,70,3
